{"product_id":"ivg-salts-riberry-lemonade","title":"IVG Salts - Riberry Lemonade","description":"\u003cp\u003eRiberry Lemonade nicotine salt e-liquid by IVG Salts is a berry fruit blend featuring a zesty kick. A combination of rich blackcurrant juicy wild berries is fused with a fizzy and sharp lemonade for a layered flavour.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis e-liquid features a 50% VG concentration, ideal for deep flavour with minimal cloud production when used in a pod device or starter kit.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuantity: 30ml e liquid concentrated with nicotine.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 50mg and 30mg\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IVG","offers":[{"title":"30MG","offer_id":42058485694519,"sku":"IVG - Riberry Lemonade 30 MG","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":42058485727287,"sku":"IVG - Riberry Lemonade 50 MG","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/ivg-salts-riberry-lemonade.webp?v=1768247010","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/ivg-salts-riberry-lemonade","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




